title: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Concurrent review
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 2 of 5, type 'Concurrent review')
intro: A review follows a stay that is already authorized, so step 2 shows the check the patient already has instead of starting a new one. It sits beside the authorization on file: what was approved, what is used and what is left. The person refreshes it only if it is old or something changed.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits' on Intake"
screen sc "Eligibility & Benefits · Concurrent review\n'The patient's last check is shown. Refresh it if it is old.'"
decision dKey "Which record does the case use?"
process pEp "The record of the patient's treatment episode\nThe same one Eligibility & Benefits keeps for that patient"
process pOwn "A case with its own check keeps it"
decision dSame "Is it for the same payer and level of care as the case?"
process pOther "The case lets go of it\nAnd Verify makes a check of its own, as for an initial request"
goto gInit "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"
screen sSum "Verification summary\nCoverage, Plan type and routing, Benefits, Authorization: 'Concurrent review'\n'Summit reviews each stay while an authorization is on file. A review is needed to continue.'\nExisting authorization: the reference, the service, the approved dates, 'N of M units used, K left'"
decision dAge "Is the check old, or for other dates?"
toast tOld "'This check is 30 hours old. Refresh it before you send.'\nNothing runs by itself: the person decides"
click cRef "Click 'Refresh verification'"
agent aV "Verify asks again, about 1.2 seconds"
store stRec "The record is replaced\nThe case still uses the patient's record"
decision dWarn "Does the check have warnings?\nCoverage lapsed, member ID, benefit, network"
goto gWarn "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Warnings and documented exceptions"
decision dNone "Does the payer need no authorization for this service?"
goto gNoAuth "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › No authorization required"
process pPaused "Verify paused in Settings: the last result stays\nWith 'The refresh ... could not run because Verify is paused in Settings. This is the last result.'"
group gFoot "Footer bar"
  click cBack "Click 'Back'"
  click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
  click cCont "Click 'Continue to Clinical documentation'"
endgroup
goto gDocs "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Required and typical documents by type"

s1 --> sc --> dKey
dKey -->|An episode is chosen| pEp --> dSame
dKey -->|The case has its own| pOwn --> dSame
dSame -->|No| pOther --> gInit
dSame -->|Yes| sSum
sSum --> dAge
dAge -->|Yes| tOld --> cRef
dAge -->|No| dWarn
sSum --> cRef --> aV --> stRec --> dWarn
aV -.-> pPaused
dWarn -->|Yes| gWarn
dWarn -->|No| dNone
dNone -->|Yes| gNoAuth
dNone -->|No| cCont
sSum --> cBack
sSum --> cSave
cCont --> gDocs
